{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_14_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_14","textTraditional":"一、三年，春，正月，公會齊侯於嬴。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_14_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_14","textTraditional":"二、夏，齊侯、衞侯胥命於蒲。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_14_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_14","textTraditional":"胥之為言猶相也。相命而信諭，謹言而退，以是為近古也。是必一人先，其以相言之何也？不以齊侯命衞侯也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_14_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_14","textTraditional":"三、六月，公會杞侯於郕。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_14_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_14","textTraditional":"四、秋，七月，壬辰，朔，日有食之，既。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_14_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_14","textTraditional":"言日言朔，食正朔也。既者，盡也，有繼之辭也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_14_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_14","textTraditional":"五、公子翬如齊逆女。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_14_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_14","textTraditional":"逆女，親者也。使大夫，非正也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_14_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_14","textTraditional":"六、九月，齊侯送姜氏於讙。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_14_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_14","textTraditional":"送女，父不下堂，母不出祭門，諸母兄弟不出闕門。父戒之曰：「謹慎從爾舅之言。」母戒之曰：「謹慎從爾姑之言。」諸母般申之曰：「謹慎從爾父母之言。」送女踰竟，非禮也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_14_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_14","textTraditional":"七、公會齊侯於讙。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_14_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_14","textTraditional":"無譏乎？曰為禮也。齊侯來也，公之逆而會之可也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_14_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_14","textTraditional":"八、夫人姜氏至自齊。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_14_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_14","textTraditional":"其不言翬之以來何也？公親受之於齊侯也。子貢曰：「冕而親迎，不已重乎？」孔子曰：「合二姓之好，以繼萬世之後，何謂已重乎？」","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_14_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_14","textTraditional":"九、冬，齊侯使其弟年來聘。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_14_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_14","textTraditional":"十、有年。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_clt_14_17","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_14","textTraditional":"五穀皆熟為有年。","sentenceOrder":17}],"overrides":{}}